football-kansas-game-to-be-televised-on-espnu-at-5-30-pm-et</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/8/football-kansas-game-to-be-televised-on-espnu-at-5-30-pm-et</guid><category>Football</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="West Virginia faces Pitt in the Backyard Brawl at Milan Puskar Stadium on Sept. 13, 2025, in Morgantown, W.Va." src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/8/12/20250913_FBvsPITT-5_F1CCJ.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The Big 12 Conference has announced that WVU's Nov. 14 Big 12 Conference football game against Kansas at Milan Puskar Stadium will be televised on ESPNU at 5:30 p.m., ET.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/8/12/20250913_FBvsPITT-5_F1CCJ.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/8/12/20250913_FBvsPITT-5_F1CCJ.jpg"><media:title>West Virginia faces Pitt in the Backyard Brawl at Milan Puskar Stadium on Sept. 13, 2025, in Morgantown, W.Va.</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/8/12/20250913_FBvsPITT-5_F1CCJ.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Sun, 8 Nov 2026 10:48:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>2</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59661</s:story_id></item><item><title>Texas Tech's Fourth-Quarter Rally Defeats West Virginia 53-48</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/8/football-texas-rallies-in-fourth-quarter-to-defeat-west-virginia</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/8/football-texas-rallies-in-fourth-quarter-to-defeat-west-virginia</guid><category>Football</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="West Virginia quarterback Micheal Hawkins scores a 3-yard touchdown in the first quarter of West Virginia's game against 13th-ranked Texas Tech at Galaxy Stadium in Lubbock, Texas." src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/11/7/Hawkins-Main.jpg" /><br /><br />Texas Tech used a 12-point fourth quarter rally to defeat upset-minded West Virginia 53-48 on Saturday night at Galaxy Stadium in Lubbock, Texas.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/7/Hawkins-Main.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/7/Hawkins-Main.jpg"><media:title>West Virginia quarterback Micheal Hawkins scores a 3-yard touchdown in the first quarter of West Virginia's game against 13th-ranked Texas Tech at Galaxy Stadium in Lubbock, Texas.</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/7/Hawkins-Main.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Sun, 8 Nov 2026 02:04:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>2</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59660</s:story_id></item><item><title>No. 23 West Virginia Rolls Past Mercyhurst</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/7/wrestling-no-23-west-virginia-rolls-past-mercyhurst</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/7/wrestling-no-23-west-virginia-rolls-past-mercyhurst</guid><category>Wrestling</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="WVU wrestlers sing Take Me Home, Country Roads following a win against Mercyhurst at Cameron High School in Cameron, W.Va., on Nov. 7, 2026." src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/11/7/Wrestling_vsMercyhurst_atCameron_Nov7_2026_AM-085.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The No. 23 West Virginia University wrestling team dominated Mercyhurst, 52-0, to open dual competition at Cameron High School in Cameron, W.Va.,